//github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116962","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116962.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116962.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-02T17:33:56Z"},"body":"Refactors `blas_create` to accept multiple geometries. What I have in mind with this is having each `AccelerationStructureGeometry` represent a `Mesh::Surface`, and create a BLAS from `Mesh`/`MeshInstance` objects. \r\n\r\nWith the previous approach, each `Mesh::Surface` would have to be its own BLAS. That would not be very efficient due to AABB overlaps and increased TLAS instance count.\r\n\r\nFurther changes to note:\r\n- Taking the vertex/index buffers instead of the vertex/index arrays. I felt the old approach was a little strange since the BLAS does not care about the other components in the vertex array at all. I think it is cleaner to expect the buffers directly.\r\n- Making the BLAS dependent on the buffers and properly bookkeeping their draw trackers. \r\n\r\nTo do:\r\n- [x] Documentation for the new class.\r\n\r\nExample: https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds/godot-raytracing-gdscript-demo/commit/2d575518edd4596c9724a1e72e11ee6115673cde","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116962/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116962/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}